From 53465a8fe6747c13cddd78fb1c66154b10e435ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rosetta <cole@phosphor.co>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 10:03:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] fix(multiplayer): carry claimed presentation through
 websocket

- Carry the existing untrusted claimed presentation from the browser to the public WebSocket boundary.
- Keep server-authored provider-qualified PrincipalKeys, configured-provider precedence, stock fallback, spoof rejection, and legacy readability intact.
- Add focused public protocol and client transport regression coverage.

